# {{.Title}}

Built with [Aemeath](https://github.com/naufalraism/aemeath).

```bash
aemeath dev        # run with hot reload
aemeath ts --out web/src/api   # TypeScript client, Zod schemas and React hooks
go test ./...      # run the tests
```

- API docs: http://localhost:3000/docs
- Typed TypeScript client: http://localhost:3000/client.ts

Generate more code with the CLI:

```bash
aemeath generate api Product   # CRUD handlers (handlers/product.go)
aemeath generate test Product  # tests for them
aemeath generate docker        # Dockerfile + docker-compose.yml
```
